change how your truck grips and climbs.\n- SET UP YOUR TRUCK: air down your tires, lock the diffs and drop into low range when the trail gets hard.\n- WINCH OUT: stuck? Hook a tree or a friend's truck and pull yourself free.\n- MANAGE YOUR FUEL: 4WD burns more. Fuel caches on the trail fill your tank and act as checkpoints.\n- MUD THAT REMEMBERS: ruts get deeper with every truck that passes, for everyone on the server.\n\nDrive solo or with friends, help each other through the hard parts, and come back to beat your best times.\n\nKeyboard, mouse and controller supported.\n\nEarly access: things will change and some will break.","thumbs":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3e674e0fb61e95183c4fb7294ff09bc3/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-419a47c52db4b1d6af65a5206cae3558/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-c8be51e913091bee2a19ba98cd3f3d18/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter"],"passes":[{"id":2061449212,"name":"Supporter Edition","price":650,"icon":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-bfc1aba15c4287bdceadb378a9cde141/150/150/Image/Webp/noFilter"},{"id":2068364069,"name":"GU Patrol","price":350,"icon":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e0a3358c81d471003a3835255579334e/150/150/Image/Webp/noFilter"},{"id":2076074586,"name":"78 Troopy","price":350,"icon":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-f141b613331e54cc2508cae7de048be9/150/150/Image/Webp/noFilter"}],"badges":[],"extrasAt":1794031213391}